                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Hey , I know it’s been a long time since the game got any major updates, but I honestly think it still has potential. It’s a shame to see a game like this slowly get left behind, especially when there are still players who enjoy it and want to see it improve.\nI know fixing old issues and working on updates takes time and effort, but even a few bug fixes and some small improvements would make a big difference. I’d genuinely love to see this game get some attention again instead of being left in its current state.\nI’m not trying to complain or put pressure on you. I just hope you haven’t completely given up on the game, because I think it still deserves a chance. Even a small update would be enough to show that the game isn’t forgotten.\nThanks you",
